          },
          "description": "Join Percy the Train and his friends Bobby the Bear, Finny the Fox, Ruby Rabbit, and Captain Ollie Owl on adventures through Hilltop Town! Listen as their \"Chugga-chugga! Clickety-clack!\" carries them through exciting journeys delivering to farms, transporting instruments, splashing through puddles, creating echoes in canyons, and bringing colorful paint to their town. Each story teaches teamwork and problem-solving through rhythmic storytelling that children will love!",
